    ('101L','ARAB','5333','This course is designed to introduce the student to the materials and techniques of drawing, focusing on the representation and interpretation of objects and natural forms. This course assumes no previous experience. Offered every semester. Fulfills the CoreLS requirement for Fine Arts.','ELEM ARAB I'),
