    ('366L','ART','5961','This course is designed to introduce students to the field of computer art. Students will learn how the digital media are transforming the fine arts, graphic design, advertising, and education. Students will explore such topics as desktop publishing, digital photography, animation, and multimedia applications, including the creation of CDROMs, through a combination of lectures, demonstrations, and handson experiences. Offered every semester.','ART 20TH CENT'),
