    ('406N','ART','6058','A study of transmission, population, molecular, and cytogenetics. Both in the classroom and the laboratory, the emphasis is on reinforcing basic concepts through a study of the classic experiments in genetics as well as current research. Threehour lecture, threehour laboratory per week. Typically offered every semester.','ART INTERN'),
