    ('151N','STUD','4417','In this course students will learn the mechanics of trend and its function in the business of fashion. This course addresses the identification, gathering, communication and presentation of trends as the responsibility and procedures of the fashion forecaster. Students will use consumerinsight techniques to understand and track trends and use them to inform their research, design and product development.','WAX CARVING+CAST TECH'),
