    ('236L','COM','3846','A basic introduction to chemistry emphasizing the language of chemistry, its fundamental concepts, and development of problemsolving skills. This course provides appropriate background for students with insufficient preparation in high school chemistry who may wish to take General Chemistry III. Two lectures per week.','NEWS EDITING'),
