    ('432N','COM','16018','None','ADVERT PORTFOLIO DVLP II'),
    ('433N','COM','16220','STSPORTS ONAIR STUDIO HOSTANCHORThis is a course designed to prepare aspiring broadcasters in the field of sports broadcasting both instudio and remote. This course offers students the opportunity to learn the necessary techniques within the studio from voicing over highlights to formulating questions to ask analysts. For playbyplay, we will examine games both on the college and professional levels, and how to construct a chart in preparation for an event. We will also go indepth as to how to formulate an open, which will include mock broadcasts. The goal of this course is properly prepare the student to pursue a career in the field of sports broadcasting.','ST:COMMUNICATIONS'),
