    ('232L','BIOL','5761','This course explores the scope of responsibilities for a buyer in todays competitive retail industry. Through the development and understanding of a companys financial  month buying plan, the student gains understanding of assortment planning, allocation, sales, promotion, merchandise procurement and the buyervendor relationship.','SEX,EVOLUTION BE'),
