    ('393L','BIOL','5807','STSPORTS MANAGEMENTThe global sports industry is over  billion with  of that in the U.S. This course provides an overview of management principles as they relate to the business of sports, including marketing, finance, economics, legal and ethical principles as they relate to sport management at the high  school, recreational, collegiate, international and professional fields. This course would be of value to students in the School of Management, sports communication, sports medicine or student athletes.','SP TOP:BIOLOGY IV'),
