    ('440L','CHEM','6332','This course provides an overview and analysis of the experiences and contributions of Blacks in the formation and development of American society and culture. Attention will be paid to slavery, race relations, religion, the arts, war, politics, economics, and civil rights.','ADV ORGANIC CHEM'),
