    ('262L','HIST','223','Presents an overview of apparel manufacturing and product development focusing on the function and practices of product development from concept to delivery. Topics include supply chain management, understanding and defining the target market, researching fashion trends from color and fabric to silhouette, specing, construction, quality control, sourcing and costing.','RUSSIAN REVOLUT'),
