    ('267L','HIST','472','An activity course stressing beginning techniques of archery. Selection and care of equipment and safety will also be stressed. Emphasis will be on standard shooting techniques with some exploration of hunting and fieldarchery techniques.','WOMEN IN ASIA'),
    ('268L','HIST','473','An activity course designed to teach the fundamentals of boxing as used in selfdefense. Technique and strategies will be discussed. Development of styles and conditioning will also be discussed.','TRADITIONAL ASIA'),
    ('269L','HIST','476','This course examines the various processes and theoretical frameworks involved in the management of advertising within an Integrated Marketing Communication context from a strategic perspective. Besides being one of the most persuasive forms of communication, advertising can be considered one of the most powerful IMC tools due to its component of paid media. Students will also explore other IMC tools. Based on marketing objectives, students will come up with appropriate communication objectives and plan a brilliant IMC campaignthat effectively accomplishes a companys or an organizations communication objectiveswith a focus on advertising. They will acquire the essential skillsets through vivid class discussions, a case study, and a team project.','MODERN ASIA'),
    ('270L','HIST','4569','This course undertakes a rigorous study of the topology of real numbers and more general spaces, taking a unified approach to sequences and series and continuity. It may also include sequences of functions, differentiation, and the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus. Offered at least biennially in the fall.','TRADITIONAL CHINA'),
