    ('250L','ITAL','1290','ST Real Estate FinanceReal estate is a multifaceted field, encompassing both an operating industry and a broad category of investments. It has its own institutional features, jargon, and investment structures. This class will offer an overview of the real estate field rather than a narrow focus on any particular topic. We will delve more deeply into a handful of aspects of the real estate field when I believe they are particularly relevant or when the examples provide a more general insight. This information is essential in business and useful in ones personal life. We will examine these topics from multiple viewpoints therefore, it is essential that the student is able to apply concepts rather than memorize definitions. Class participation is welcomed and expected. The material to be learned for the exams will come from lecture material, the course textbook and class discussions.','CIVILIZ OF ITALY'),
