    ('351L','ENG','8285','This course introduces students to the practice of social science research in communication contexts. Students will learn to synthesize sources and create a literature review. Students will also practice research design and strategy, data collection, and analysis for both qualitative and quantitative methodologies. Offered in fall and spring.','COMPOSITION THRY'),
