    ('370N','FASH','8774','A survey of principles and practices of Hatha Yoga for beginners. The class will consist of warmup and stretching exercises designed to relax and lengthen muscles. Each lesson will include postures and asanas in conjunction with natural breathing. The group will start with basic postures and progress to the advanced and morecomplex activities.','KNITWEAR DESIGN'),
