    ('305N','MAP','1413','In this course, students develop an understanding of PR in terms of strategic management. Students will gain reallife experience through the exploration of various communication theories, trends, and issues. Students will develop a comprehensive PR plan, with an emphasis on the role of PR in the IMC process that meets specific business and communication needs. The course is designed to give marketing graduate students a thorough understanding of PR as a strategic function of marketing and brand management.','MARIST ABROAD PRO'),
