    ('293L','PHIL','2676','Dual listed as CSFR  Taught in French. Interdisciplinary survey of Frances social, artistic, political, and intellectual history from its origins to the th century, with an emphasis on the manner in which the past has shaped and is still influencing the modern French consciousness. Offered every fall.','SP TOP:PHIL'),
