    ('545L','MSIS','4979','CMPT  is the first in a twosemestersequence capping course for Computer Science majors. During the first semester, students study project management techniques, review oral presentation skills, study creating software documentation, assemble project teams integrated teams including students in the ITS capping course, select a project client, perform analysis and design, and begin project implementation. The second semester is used to complete project implementation. The capping experience culminates with an oral presentation to the client and delivery of the software and its documentation.','INTRO TO DATA ANALYSIS'),
