    ('620L','MSIS','9600','This course introduces the student to basic principles, materials, and techniques used in printmaking. Individual instruction will be directed toward each students development of a strong personal statement. Through lectures, demonstrations, and handson experiences, students will become familiar with both traditional and contemporary approaches. Offered every year.','EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES'),
