    ('602L','PSYH','3241','This course introduces one of the basic computational tools of calculus the derivative. Functional models, including linear, quadratic, exponential, and logarithmic models are developed. These ideas and techniques are applied to study situations from business and other disciplines. This course is offered every semester. Appropriate technology will be selected by the instructor.','CONSULT IN SCHOOL'),
